    "A few minutes later, Bruno looks around and can't see anyone from his class. He starts to feel a little scared. He walks down several hallways, but he can't find his classmates or his teacher.",
    "A museum guide named Marisol sees Bruno alone near the art room. \"Are you lost?\" she asks him in a kind voice. Bruno explains that he lost his class while he was looking at the dinosaurs.",
